# Links lychee should not verify.
#
# The demo gifs under examples/ are build artifacts, not committed files
# (.gitignore excludes examples/*/*.gif). The markdown gallery deliberately
# keeps the repo-relative path as a placeholder: `rendertapes -publish`
# rewrites exactly that string into the hosted Charm URL, so removing the
# links would leave the publish pipeline with nothing to rewrite.
#
# .github/workflows/demos.yml runs that publish on merge to the default
# branch and opens a PR with the real URLs. Until it does, the paths point at
# files that only exist on a machine that has rendered them, so the link
# check has to skip them.
examples/.*\.gif$
